---
// Points people at the printable download poster (/poster).
---
<a class="poster-callout card" href="/poster">
  <img src="/poster/hot-mess-poster-preview.png" alt="" width="120" height="155" loading="lazy" />
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Print it. Post it.</p>
    <h3>Put Hot Mess up in your queer spaces</h3>
    <p class="muted">Our poster has one QR code that works on iPhone and Android. Print a few for your bar, community center or bookstore.</p>
    <span class="go">Get the poster →</span>
  </div>
</a>

<style>
  .poster-callout { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .poster-callout:hover .go { text-decoration: underline; }
  .poster-callout img { width: 120px; height: auto; flex: none; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #ff3d9a, 8px 8px 0 #1e8cff; transform: rotate(-3deg); }
  .poster-callout h3 { margin: 0 0 .4rem; font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .poster-callout p { margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; font-size: .85rem; margin: 0 0 .4rem; }
  .go { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .poster-callout img { width: 84px; } }
</style>
